sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant App as Mobile Client
    participant Img as imageUtils (resize/compress)
    participant Fn as Cloud Function\n(analyzeFoodPhoto)
    participant Gem as Gemini Vision API
    participant Cal as Calorie Calibration Model\n(linear regression)
    participant Fs as Firestore

    U->>App: Capture / pick food photo
    App->>Img: Resize & compress (max 1024px)
    Img->>App: Compressed image
    App->>Fn: Call analyzeFoodPhoto(image)
    Fn->>Gem: Send photo + structured response schema
    Gem-->>Fn: Items, calories, macros,\nfreshness, health tip
    Fn->>Cal: Cross-check estimated calories\n(if item matches reference table)
    Cal-->>Fn: Calibration note (or none)
    Fn->>Fs: Save result to users/{uid}/foodLogs
    Fn-->>App: Return analysis result
    App-->>U: Display calories, macros,\ncondition, health tip
